{"3936460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Endless Drive", "steam_appid": 3936460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Drive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Drive is an arcade-style driving game where you take on the role of a driver on an endless, procedurally generated road. Your main goal is to travel as far as possible and make as much money as possible within a single run. To do this, you'll need to skillfully navigate traffic, evade various obstacles, and escape not just the police, but also The Mafia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <i><strong> </strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/4e93bab69923573b536d6786d7c300a1.poster.avif?t=1757970049\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/4e93bab69923573b536d6786d7c300a1.webm?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/4e93bab69923573b536d6786d7c300a1.mp4?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/35ba4d708bfeb270acc26b557a4f6119.poster.avif?t=1757970049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/35ba4d708bfeb270acc26b557a4f6119.webm?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/35ba4d708bfeb270acc26b557a4f6119.mp4?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While driving down the road, players will encounter various side missions (jobs), which some will be legal and some maybe not (different jobs will have different pros and cons). These jobs range from standard taxi and delivery services to high-risk smuggling and hired gun missions that test your driving ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn extra cash, make sure to master <strong>drifting</strong> around each corner, take all the <strong>jumps</strong> that you can possibly take, and hit that gas pedal anytime you see a <strong>speed camera</strong>. The more successful you are, the more money you'll earn to unlock new vehicles, roads, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/f29d7e737fc5b461aa74718734a9d4f5.poster.avif?t=1757970049\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/f29d7e737fc5b461aa74718734a9d4f5.webm?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/f29d7e737fc5b461aa74718734a9d4f5.mp4?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/802b7595b8423401fbd9e719126c46f6.avif?t=1757970049\" width=1128 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will be able to experience a cinematic story that culminates in a full-blown war against a ruthless Mafia boss who views this world as his personal empire. This evolving story features a dynamic cast of characters and relationships that will shape your journey, offering an experience you can get lost in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>  </i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >     </h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Drive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Drive is an arcade-style driving game where you take on the role of a driver on an endless, procedurally generated road. Your main goal is to travel as far as possible and make as much money as possible within a single run. To do this, you'll need to skillfully navigate traffic, evade various obstacles, and escape not just the police, but also The Mafia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <i><strong> </strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/4e93bab69923573b536d6786d7c300a1.poster.avif?t=1757970049\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/4e93bab69923573b536d6786d7c300a1.webm?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/4e93bab69923573b536d6786d7c300a1.mp4?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/35ba4d708bfeb270acc26b557a4f6119.poster.avif?t=1757970049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/35ba4d708bfeb270acc26b557a4f6119.webm?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/35ba4d708bfeb270acc26b557a4f6119.mp4?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While driving down the road, players will encounter various side missions (jobs), which some will be legal and some maybe not (different jobs will have different pros and cons). These jobs range from standard taxi and delivery services to high-risk smuggling and hired gun missions that test your driving ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn extra cash, make sure to master <strong>drifting</strong> around each corner, take all the <strong>jumps</strong> that you can possibly take, and hit that gas pedal anytime you see a <strong>speed camera</strong>. The more successful you are, the more money you'll earn to unlock new vehicles, roads, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/f29d7e737fc5b461aa74718734a9d4f5.poster.avif?t=1757970049\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/f29d7e737fc5b461aa74718734a9d4f5.webm?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/f29d7e737fc5b461aa74718734a9d4f5.mp4?t=1757970049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/extras/802b7595b8423401fbd9e719126c46f6.avif?t=1757970049\" width=1128 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will be able to experience a cinematic story that culminates in a full-blown war against a ruthless Mafia boss who views this world as his personal empire. This evolving story features a dynamic cast of characters and relationships that will shape your journey, offering an experience you can get lost in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>  </i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >     </h2>", "short_description": "Endless Drive: An arcade driving game where every road is a chance to get rich. Master drifts and speed to earn cash, take on legal or illegal jobs, and outrun the Mafia and police. Your loyalty and choices will determine who survives in this endless urban chase.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/566b654f7eeb830d751056085deebc200587a6c4/header.jpg?t=1757970049", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/db7a3782f821b9e27b7efae004c6602694d81a01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757970049", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936460/db7a3782f821b9e27b7efae004c6602694d81a01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757970049", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-7500U Processor<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 650</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3060</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ovenbaked Games"], "publishers": ["Ovenbaked Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "9", "description": 